Opt-in marker for ~/.claude/hooks/require-test-evidence.mjs (P1, STRIATUM_REWARD section 4).

With this file present, `git commit` in this repo is BLOCKED unless the transcript
shows a test command that ran and passed. Chosen for ruuah-vt first because it is
the repo where a green claim actually costs something: on 2026-07-30 a red run got
pushed here because `grep | awk` swallowed cargo's exit code, and SCAR-014 was
registered after GUI-seam features were tagged [tested] on C-surface proof alone.

Recognised suites: cargo test, bun/npm/pnpm/yarn test, vitest, jest, pytest, go test.
The gate reads the transcript, so the run has to be visible in this session, not
remembered from an earlier one.

Override, Orel only: `! touch /tmp/.claude-approved` opens a 60 second window.
Remove this file to opt the repo back out.

